[{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0010","text":"……嗯——！\n这个好喝！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0020","text":"这个……这个……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0030","text":"……金平牛蒡？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0040","text":"那个！\n灯织要吃吗！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0050","text":"没关系，我的便当里也有\n很好吃呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0060","text":"嗯嗯，对吧！\n真乃的便当里有吗——？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0070","text":"我的……好像没有"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0080","text":"是吗！？\n那我的分给你！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0090","text":"巡，你也太激动了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0100","text":"嘿嘿\n因为真的很好吃嘛……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0110","text":"呵呵……\n…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0120","text":"真的呢\n这个金平牛蒡，好好吃……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0130","text":"打扰了——不好意思\n还有10分钟休息时间就结束了哦——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0140","text":"……好、好的，知道了\n谢谢您……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0150","text":"光顾着聊天了\n吃得太慢了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0160","text":"是啊\n接下来专心吃饭吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0170","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0180","text":"──让各位久等了——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0190","text":"好——的，时间刚刚好……！\n那么拍摄继续——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_01010000_02_0200","text":"请多指教……！"}]
